WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.067 line:92%
-This morning on her show,

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
Megyn Kelly invited
a panel of guests

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:03.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
to discuss
whether or not it's racist

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:05.638 size:88% position:44%
for white people to wear
blackface on Halloween.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:06.239 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Take a look.

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:07.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But what is racist?
-But --

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:09.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because -- Because, truly,
you do get in trouble

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:12.645
if you are a white person who
puts on blackface on Halloween,

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:15.048 align:start size:94% position:6%
or a black person who puts on
white face for Halloween.

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:15.482 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:17.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like, back when I was a kid,
that was okay.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.786
There was a controversy on "The
Real Housewives of New York"

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:20.487 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
with Luann.

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:22.088 line:92%
And she dressed as Diana Ross.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:24.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she made her skin
look darker than it really is.

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:26.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
And people said that
that was racist.

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:28.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I don't know --
I thought, like,

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:29.763 line:92%
who doesn't love Diana Ross?

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:31.564 size:84% position:42%
She wants to look like
Diana Ross for one day,

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:35.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know how, like,
that got racist on Halloween.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:38.538
-Now, commenting on the racially
charged issue of blackface

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:41.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
is not something
I'm comfortable doing.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:42.342 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-But I am!

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:45.879 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.849 line:92%
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:52.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
First of all,
I heard about this,

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:53.420 line:92%
and when I went to watch it,

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.389
I started typing in,
"Megyn Kelly defends blackface."

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:59.626
It auto-filled "Megyn Kelly
defends Brett Kavanaugh,"

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:03.797
so I knew, no matter what, I was
about to watch a terrible video.

00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:05.565 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I was right.

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:06.132 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Megyn said,

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:11.004
"I don't know how blackface
is racist on Halloween."

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:11.905 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Sighs ]

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.973 line:92%
It's not racist on Halloween.

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.109 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It's racist every day.

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:17.243 size:84% position:42% line:92%
There is no magical day

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:20.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
where you can wear blackface
with no repercussions.

00:01:20.547 --> 00:01:22.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
Unless all of your friends
are white,

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:26.519
and I'm guessing all of
Megyn Kelly's friends are white.

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:27.153 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:30.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
Speaking of a bunch
of white people, this panel.

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:32.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
White, white, white, white.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:35.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Ooh, so very white.

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:38.832
How are you gonna have a bunch
of white people sit together

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:40.600 line:92%
and figure out what's racist?

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:43.103
White people don't get to decide
what's racist.

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:47.173
If I punch you, I don't decide
if it hurts or not -- you do.

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:50.510
And it won't because
I'm not punching no white lady,

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:52.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I don't want
to go to jail.

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:53.012 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:58.151
Megyn Kelly said, "Blackface
wasn't racist when I was a kid."

00:01:58.151 --> 00:01:59.385 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You're 47.

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:02.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
Racism wasn't invented
40 years ago.

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:02.856 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
40 years ago,

00:02:02.856 --> 00:02:05.992 align:start size:94% position:6%
they were just getting
into the swing of it, baby.

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:06.960 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.895 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Today, it's perfected.

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:11.064
You may think the meanest thing
I could do

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:13.466 align:start size:94% position:6%
is call Megyn Kelly's words
racist,

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:15.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, really,
the meanest thing I did

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:17.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
was tell everyone she's 47...
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:20.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
...which, if you round up,
is 50.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:21.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's 50.
Tell everybody.

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:24.144
-Amber, that's ageist.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:25.745 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I'm kidding.

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:26.646 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
She's 60.

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:28.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Amber!
-What?

00:02:28.515 --> 00:02:29.149 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm 103.

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:31.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just look this good
'cause black don't crack.

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:33.019 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:36.623 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:39.058 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Applause continues ]

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:42.762 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Applause continues ]

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:46.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look, Megyn Kelly
asked a question,

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:47.934 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and here's the answer --

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:48.935 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
blackface is racist

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:51.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
because it turns black people
into a costume

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:53.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
and divorces them
from their humanity.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.241 line:92%
We're people, not costumes.

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:58.912
But more importantly, it ignores
the severely racist context

00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:01.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
in which blackface was
introduced into this country,

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:06.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
and actions don't exist
separate from their context.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:07.453 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Sighs ]

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:10.690 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.058 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Whoo!

00:03:12.058 --> 00:03:12.559 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I agree!

00:03:12.559 --> 00:03:14.994 align:start size:94% position:6%
Megyn Kelly
issued an apologize later,

00:03:14.994 --> 00:03:16.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
but she wouldn't
have had to do that

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:20.700
if she had invited a black
person into the conversation

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:21.367 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
in the first place.

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:24.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, honestly, you shouldn't
need a black panelist

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:24.771 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
to explain to you

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:27.774
[bleep] you should have figured
out 57 years ago.

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:29.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Amber!
-Whatever.

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:31.477 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:31.477 --> 00:03:32.145 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
She's 75.

00:03:32.145 --> 00:03:33.346 align:start size:94% position:6%
But for someone...
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.346 --> 00:03:36.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
...for someone with
a morning show, Megyn Kelly,

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:38.151 line:92%
you sure are late as hell.

00:03:38.151 --> 00:03:38.985 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience ohhs ]

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:41.688
-Amber Ruffin, everybody.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:45.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, oh. Here she comes.
And there she goes.

